# Scripts run on Linux (clusters, the container): check out every text file with LF,
# whatever core.autocrlf says. A CRLF copy would break every shell script.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Not part of the public pipeline: `git archive` leaves these out, and
# tests/test_public_tree.py scans everything else for lab-specific content.
#   container/  the image recipe (moves to the images repository)
#   lab/        lab-only and deployment helpers (private staging)
container/ export-ignore
lab/ export-ignore
